@startuml
title Destination Search and Information Module : View Ratings and Reviews

actor "Traveller" as Actor
participant UI as ":destinationDetails"
participant Ctrl as ":destinationController"
participant API as ":serpApiGoogleMapsAPI"

Actor -> UI: Select View Ratings And Reviews
UI -> Ctrl: Request Ratings And Reviews
Ctrl -> API: retrieveRatingsAndReviews(destinationId)
API --> Ctrl: Rating Review Result
alt [Request successful]
  alt [Ratings and reviews available]
    Ctrl --> UI: Display Ratings And Reviews
  else [Rating only available]
    Ctrl --> UI: Display Rating Only
  else [No reviews available]
    Ctrl --> UI: Display No Reviews Available
  end
else [Request failed]
  Ctrl --> UI: Display Unable To Load Ratings And Reviews
end

@enduml
